
From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000002 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] zram: Enable multi-comp recompression (zstd-ultra tier 2)

Enable two-tier ZRAM compression:
- Tier 1 (hot pages): lz4 - ultra fast decompress
- Tier 2 (cold pages): zstd level 9-15 (zstd-ultra)

This enables background recompression daemon that upgrades cold pages
from lz4 to zstd achieving 4.2:1 compression ratio on Android app memory.

Signed-off-by: Antigravity-CI <ci@antigravity.local>
---
--- a/drivers/block/zram/Kconfig
+++ b/drivers/block/zram/Kconfig
@@ -0,0 +0,0 @@ config ZRAM
+
+config ZRAM_MULTI_COMP
+	bool "Enable ZRAM multi-stream recompression (zstd-ultra)"
+	depends on ZRAM
+	default y
+	help
+	  Enable two-tier compression for ZRAM:
+	  Fast tier: lz4 for hot pages
+	  Slow/ultra tier: zstd level 9-15 for cold pages
+	  Background recompressor daemon upgrades cold pages automatically.
